  "title": "Shard fan-out must aggregate control errors explicitly",
  "mechanism": "At the pinned TGI revision, sharded info, health and filter_batch await every shard but return only the last Result; prefill, decode and clear_cache collect all Results. Generation lists are merged last shard first and the retained next_batch comes from that last shard. v2 warmup drops None values before choosing a minimum; v3 chooses a lexicographic minimum of a tuple. These are distinct aggregation contracts.",
  "corrections": [
    "Use build.rs:16-20 for the v2 protoc error branch.",
    "Treat underlying tonic deadlines, transport cancellation and server cache lifetime as unverified.",
    "The warmup image's PNG bytes and JPEG MIME mismatch are source facts; acceptance by a deployed decoder was not tested.",
    "Do not infer all-shard health or component-wise v3 token minima from the returned control result."
  ],
